        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1669">

                <pb facs="1365" n="1249" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1249"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/116.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 84.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 9, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my despatch No. 79 of the 5th
                    instant, I have the honor to enclose a copy of a note dated the 2nd instant,
                    which I addressed to Señor Arjona, Minister for Foreign Affairs, conveying to
                    him and to the Panaman Government a repeated expression of the thanks and
                    appreciation of the Secretary of State for the reception tendered to him by the
                    Panaman Government, as well as a copy and translation of the reply of Señor
                    Arjona, dated the 6th instant. Señor Arjona has subsequently taken occasion to
                    thank me for the opportunity afforded to him by my note for placing upon record
                    the sincere appreciation of President Chiari and of the Panaman Government for
                    the Secretary’s visit.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Percival Dodge.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d1669-a1.xml" xpointer="d1669-a1"/>
